1
00:00:00,950 --> 00:00:04,200
(Howard:)Hi, there. Howard Wolowitz.

2
00:00:04,370 --> 00:00:06,370
Ester Rosenblatt.

3
00:00:12,628 --> 00:00:16,468
(Penny:)I don't think the manager's coming tonight,
so here.

4
00:00:16,632 --> 00:00:19,632
Are you suggesting I sleep on the couch?

5
00:00:19,802 --> 00:00:22,432
(Penny:)Well, it wasn't the first suggestion
that came to mind...

6
00:00:22,596 --> 00:00:24,436
(Penny:)...but it's the one I'm going with.

7
00:00:25,099 --> 00:00:27,939
(Sheldon:)I can't sleep on your couch.
I sleep in a bed.

8
00:00:28,102 --> 00:00:30,772
Given its dimensions,
I have no intention of living out...

9
00:00:30,938 --> 00:00:34,648
(Sheldon:)...E.M. Snickering's beloved children's book,
The Tall Man From Cornwall.

10
00:00:36,027 --> 00:00:37,607
(Raj:)What?

11
00:00:37,987 --> 00:00:41,617
(Sheldon:)There was a tall man from Cornwall
Whose length exceeded his bed

12
00:00:41,782 --> 00:00:52,022
(Sheldon:)My body fits on it, but barely upon it
There's no room for my big Cornish head

